    <faultIsolation>
      <faultIsolationProcedure>
        <fault faultCode="NAYATANK-DA1-004"/>
        <faultDescr><descr>Motor ısındıktan sonra da egzozdan koyu siyah, mavi ya da beyaz duman çıkıyor.</descr></faultDescr>
        <isolationProcedure>
          <preliminaryRqmts><reqCondGroup><noConds/></reqCondGroup><reqSupportEquips><noSupportEquips/></reqSupportEquips><reqSupplies><noSupplies/></reqSupplies><reqSpares><noSpares/></reqSpares><reqSafety><noSafety/></reqSafety></preliminaryRqmts>
          <isolationMainProcedure>
            <isolationStep id="stp-0001">
              <action>Motoru rölantide çalıştırın ve dumanın rengine bakın.</action>
              <isolationStepQuestion>Duman siyah mı?</isolationStepQuestion>
              <isolationStepAnswer><yesNoAnswer><yesAnswer nextActionRefId="stp-0002"/><noAnswer nextActionRefId="stp-0003"/></yesNoAnswer></isolationStepAnswer>
            </isolationStep>
            <isolationStep id="stp-0002">
              <action>Hava filtresi göstergesine ve hava emme kanallarına bakın.</action>
              <isolationStepQuestion>Filtre tıkalı ya da kanal açık mı?</isolationStepQuestion>
              <isolationStepAnswer><yesNoAnswer><yesAnswer nextActionRefId="end-air"/><noAnswer nextActionRefId="end-injection"/></yesNoAnswer></isolationStepAnswer>
            </isolationStep>
            <isolationStep id="stp-0003">
              <action>Duman mavi ise motor yağı seviyesine bakın.</action>
              <isolationStepQuestion>Duman mavi ve yağ hızla eksiliyor mu?</isolationStepQuestion>
              <isolationStepAnswer><yesNoAnswer><yesAnswer nextActionRefId="end-oil"/><noAnswer nextActionRefId="stp-0004"/></yesNoAnswer></isolationStepAnswer>
            </isolationStep>
            <isolationStep id="stp-0004">
              <action>Duman beyaz ise soğutma sıvısı seviyesine bakın.</action>
              <isolationStepQuestion>Soğutma sıvısı eksiliyor mu?</isolationStepQuestion>
              <isolationStepAnswer><yesNoAnswer><yesAnswer nextActionRefId="end-coolant"/><noAnswer nextActionRefId="end-exhaust"/></yesNoAnswer></isolationStepAnswer>
            </isolationStep>
            <isolationProcedureEnd id="end-air"><action>Hava filtresini değiştirin, kanalları onarın. <dmRef><dmRefIdent><dmCode modelIdentCode="NAYATANK" systemDiffCode="AAA" systemCode="DA1" subSystemCode="4" subSubSystemCode="0" assyCode="00" disassyCode="00" disassyCodeVariant="AA" infoCode="920" infoCodeVariant="A" itemLocationCode="A"/></dmRefIdent></dmRef></action></isolationProcedureEnd>
            <isolationProcedureEnd id="end-injection"><action>Hava yolu normal: enjeksiyon sistemi arızalı olabilir; motoru zorlamayın, yetkili bakım birimine bildirin. Onarımdan sonra çalıştırma testini yapın. <dmRef><dmRefIdent><dmCode modelIdentCode="NAYATANK" systemDiffCode="AAA" systemCode="DA1" subSystemCode="1" subSubSystemCode="0" assyCode="00" disassyCode="00" disassyCodeVariant="AA" infoCode="320" infoCodeVariant="A" itemLocationCode="A"/></dmRefIdent></dmRef></action></isolationProcedureEnd>
            <isolationProcedureEnd id="end-oil"><action>Motor yağ yakıyor; seviyeyi tamamlayın ve yetkili bakım birimine bildirin. <dmRef><dmRefIdent><dmCode modelIdentCode="NAYATANK" systemDiffCode="AAA" systemCode="DA1" subSystemCode="2" subSubSystemCode="0" assyCode="00" disassyCode="00" disassyCodeVariant="AA" infoCode="300" infoCodeVariant="A" itemLocationCode="A"/></dmRefIdent></dmRef></action></isolationProcedureEnd>
            <isolationProcedureEnd id="end-coolant"><action>Soğutma sıvısı yanma odasına geçiyor olabilir; motoru çalıştırmayın ve bildirin. <dmRef><dmRefIdent><dmCode modelIdentCode="NAYATANK" systemDiffCode="AAA" systemCode="DA1" subSystemCode="3" subSubSystemCode="0" assyCode="00" disassyCode="00" disassyCodeVariant="AA" infoCode="300" infoCodeVariant="A" itemLocationCode="A"/></dmRefIdent></dmRef></action></isolationProcedureEnd>
            <isolationProcedureEnd id="end-exhaust"><action>Soğuk motorda kısa süreli beyaz duman olağandır; egzoz borularını ve kelepçeleri kontrol edin. <dmRef><dmRefIdent><dmCode modelIdentCode="NAYATANK" systemDiffCode="AAA" systemCode="DA1" subSystemCode="4" subSubSystemCode="0" assyCode="00" disassyCode="00" disassyCodeVariant="AA" infoCode="310" infoCodeVariant="A" itemLocationCode="A"/></dmRefIdent></dmRef></action></isolationProcedureEnd>
          </isolationMainProcedure>
          <closeRqmts><reqCondGroup><noConds/></reqCondGroup></closeRqmts>
        </isolationProcedure>
